<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK SHAREHOLDERS MEETING THURS.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK SHAREHOLDERS MEETING THURS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Greece will hold an extraordinary shareholders meeting at 13:00 local on Thursday April 3, 1997 to discuss the issue of a second-tier bond loan, it said. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301-3311812-4</p>
</text>
